{"title": "Obsidian Laced Robe", "pageid": 10187, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Obsidian_Laced_Robe", "categories": ["Clothing", "Rare items", "Sources of Fire damage", "Fire set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-rare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Obsidian_Laced_Robe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Obsidian_Laced_Robe_Icon.png/300px-Obsidian_Laced_Robe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/f2/Obsidian_Laced_Robe_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Obsidian Laced Robe image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Obsidian_Laced_Robe_Icon.png/300px-Obsidian_Laced_Robe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Obsidian_Laced_Robe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Obsidian Laced Robe</span></a> is rare piece of <a href=\"/wiki/Clothing\" title=\"Clothing\">Clothing</a> that deals <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span> damage to enemies on successful <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a> against their spells, and grants its wearer <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types#Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span> damage.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>The inside of this robe is dark and faceted like volcanic glass, yet the material is light and soft. Against the skin, it also produces a heat like a toasty fire on a day of snow.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clothing\" title=\"Clothing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Clothing_Icon.png/25px-Clothing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Clothing_Icon.png/38px-Clothing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Clothing_Icon.png/50px-Clothing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Clothing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Clothing_Icon.png/25px-Clothing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Clothing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Clothing\" title=\"Clothing\">Clothing</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BFFF ;\">Rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 1.8 kg (3.6 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 1.8 kg (3.6 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 800 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  800  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Heat_Fire_Robe</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Heat_Fire_Robe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Heat_Fire_Robe\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">63df7557-efe6-4e11-8a0d-10ab211ac1b8</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:63df7557-efe6-4e11-8a0d-10ab211ac1b8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:63df7557-efe6-4e11-8a0d-10ab211ac1b8\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Heat_Fire_Robe</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Heat_Fire_Robe+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Heat_Fire_Robe+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Grants <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Revenge\" title=\"Flaming Revenge\">Flaming Revenge</a></dt><dd>On a successful <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> against a foe's <a href=\"/wiki/Spell\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell\">spell</a>, deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d4 + <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency bonus\">proficiency bonus</a></span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage to them.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light Inn</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-31&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;130</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Talli\" title=\"Talli\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png/25px-Portrait_Talli.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png/38px-Portrait_Talli.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png/50px-Portrait_Talli.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Quartermaster Talli\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png/25px-Portrait_Talli.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d2/Portrait_Talli.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Talli\" title=\"Talli\">Quartermaster Talli</a> near the Last Light Inn waypoint</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Flaming Revenge:</i></p>\n<ul><li>When Flaming Revenge fires, the wearer is not considered the source of damage. This means it does not break <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/30px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/40px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sanctuary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp/20px-Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Sanctuary_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sanctuary\" title=\"Sanctuary\">Sanctuary</a>, but also does not trigger features from items, like the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Braindrain_Gloves\" title=\"Braindrain Gloves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Gloves_Leather_H_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Braindrain_Gloves\" title=\"Braindrain Gloves\">Braindrain Gloves</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 535.33333333333px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 533.33333333333px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Châu Nguyễn Thị Hoài.\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg/800px-Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg/1200px-Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/70/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg/1600px-Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept art by Châu Nguyễn Thị Hoài.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/70/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg/800px-Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"534\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/70/Chau-nguy-n-th-hoai-ngthchau-firerobe-1.jpeg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Concept art by Châu Nguyễn Thị Hoài. </div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 114px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 112px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Obsidian_Laced_Robe_Human_Front_Model.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Body Type 1 Front Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3d/Obsidian_Laced_Robe_Human_Front_M